um.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T17:35:56-08:00","id":1042701,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1042575-mortal-remains-tooth-and-nail?p=1042590#post1042590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's got Cthulhu on the cover. Sorry to ruin the tease. He's small, looks like it's in a hospital, fighting a patient of some sort imbued with magic power.<br /> <br /> It's pretty big section, though, I was expecting much smaller. Has its own group and lots of powers for Beasts. Seem to be rules for Dream Worlds, too.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd call it a Starspawn rather than big C himself, but yeah, it's pretty cool. Made it up to the Ashwood Abbey section, which has redeemed the organization a bit with its self-awareness of how fucked up some of their members are. The Aegis Kai Doru section has some pretty cool ideas too, what with culturally know relics being hidden (or perhaps created?) in the Primordial Dream and Lairs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T18:04:37-08:00","id":1042721,"title":"","content":"I was wondering why I couldn't find this thread, I was looking in the Beast section.<br /> <br /> I get why it could be a Starspawn but, really, I think if someone's going to make a Horror for their character they're going to go big, at least figuratively. Liked the Ashwood Abbey part myself. Really a nice sized supplement. Got a compact, a conspiracy, tactics, endowments, merits. Gonna be fun to read fully.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T19:11:43-08:00","id":1042745,"title":"","content":"I'm a little proud here because I was pushing for this stretch goal before it was announced, so I may have had some impact on it happening <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T19:53:42-08:00","id":1042764,"title":"","content":"I'm a tad disappointed in the joke they went for with The Cheiron Group entry. ED meds primarily treat a physical circulatory issue, not a lack of desire. To go with the &quot;implanting Hunger&quot; theme, it would have been a lot more poignant IMO to address how clinical depression deadens emotions and desires, and using &quot;Hungers&quot; to shock people out of that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T22:38:28-08:00","id":1042821,"title":"","content":"I really liked that bit! Beast has badly needed a non-sympathetic outside perspective, and Hunter is perfect for getting outside the mythic cycle of Beast vs. Hero and treating them as just another monster with delusions of grandeur in a world full of them. I love the idea of a Cheiron field team going &quot;we're gonna go ahead and harvest your soul to make dick pills for middle-aged dads, K?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-03T04:16:36-08:00","id":1042882,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Beasts of legend serve an essential role in Cheiron Group operations: They print money.&quot; - HtV: Tooth &amp; Nail pg.12<br /> <br /> Thank you Onyx Path. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-03T08:21:15-08:00","id":1042963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1042575-mortal-remains-tooth-and-nail?p=1042764#post1042764\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a tad disappointed in the joke they went for with The Cheiron Group entry. ED meds primarily treat a physical circulatory issue, not a lack of desire. To go with the &quot;implanting Hunger&quot; theme, it would have been a lot more poignant IMO to address how clinical depression deadens emotions and desires, and using &quot;Hungers&quot; to shock people out of that.</div> </div> </div> </div>On the other hand, The Cheiron Group doesn't do standard procedures or medical practices, and their bottom line hunger is egregiously the dollar bill(/peso/euro/etc.). Cheiron is as uncaring and hungry as the Beasts, and they <i>don't</i> care about poignancy-if an implant resembles a lesson, it's a joke shared around the office, such as presented here.<br /> <br /> THink of Cheiron as an example that the Insatiable aren't the only ones who remind Beasts that their Lives matter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-03T08:27:43-08:00","id":1042966,"title":"","content":"My point wasn't what Cheiron would choose to do, it's what implanting hungers would do effectively. As I said, ED is primarily circulatory, not a lack of desire problem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-03T11:41:58-08:00","id":1043063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1042575-mortal-remains-tooth-and-nail?p=1042966#post1042966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My point wasn't what Cheiron would choose to do, it's what implanting hungers would do effectively. As I said, ED is primarily circulatory, not a lack of desire problem.</div> </div> </div> </div>This still presumes you're looking at what Cheiron does as purely medical. It's not. It's the result of psycho-spiritual surgery, and when those are the words you start with. the pragmatics of ED go out the window.<br /> <br /> Cheiron's medical practices are all times suspect, and just as often a matter of surgery-as-ritual as it is conventional surgery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-03T17:31:55-08:00","id":1043265,"title":"","content":"I'm a little lost with terms utilized. When the book says Dream World it is referencing to Primordial Dream, just simple dreams or Astral Realms in general?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8049-53rv3r1n0","name":"53rv3r1n0","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-03T17:35:50-08:00","id":1043269,"title":"","content":"I think in the context of Hunter they mean the Astral Realms as a whole, since the Primordial Dream (the Nightmare) is a facet of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T11:28:31-07:00","id":1067709,"title":"","content":"I'm surprised The Lucifuge didn't get a new Castigation to deal with Beasts considering the rare enmity they have for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5391-krycanelo","name":"Krycanelo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5391_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T15:53:35-07:00","id":1067827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krycanelo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1042575-mortal-remains-tooth-and-nail?p=1067709#post1067709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm surprised The Lucifuge didn't get a new Castigation to deal with Beasts considering the rare enmity they have for them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah. It was the one thing I didn't like about Tooth and Nail. Aside from the new guys, the Aegis Kai Doru, and the Ascending Ones, none of the other conspiracies got new Endowments tailored to handling the Begotten. It's why I ended up brewing up a new Benediction <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1045667-homebrew-benedictions?p=1045669#post1045669\">here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T16:54:40-07:00","id":1067844,"title":"","content":"Thought up of this for the Lucifuge<br /> <br /> Castigation<br /> <br /> Iron City Of Dis<br /> The city of Dis found in the literature of Dante Alighieri, supposedly guarded by fallen angels, the furies and medusa and represents the very antithesis of the heavenly city. Some members of the Lucifuge find that they hold a special place In the Iron city and call call upon it to some degree to combat monsters with the ability to warp the terrain around them and seemingly transport one to another world. This castigation works by imposing the architecture of the Iron city on the extra dimensional environments such as the twilight or a beast's lair, being able to override the features and present the hunter with a home field advantage or at least nullify the monster's. To activate this power the hunter spends a point of willpower, takes 1 lethal damage from the blood sacrifice and rolls resolve+occult, contested by resolve+power stat if it's an imposed reality such as a beast's lair.<br /> Dramatic Failure: not only does the iron city refuse to come to the fore but the powers of hell lash out against the hunter dealing a point of lethal damage.<br /> Failure: the iron city doesn't appear.<br /> Success: the terrain around the hunter shifts and bends to resemble a portion of the iron city of Dis, this creates an environment the Hunter is familiar with and negates bonuses any opponents might get from the terrain. Having your own realm changed before your eyes is also bound to have some psychological effect. The hunter and any other hunters with castigation also gain a +3 to rolls to activate their castigations, this is a drawback in its own way as it increases the chances of scoring an exceptional success.<br /> Exceptional Success: the Hunter gains 2 dice to perception rolls and +2 initiative while within the Iron City.<br /> Note: this does not change the physical world, it only works on dream worlds, the shadow, the hedge or other such realms but is especially attuned to work in a beast's lair. In any other environment the hunter makes his roll at a -2 penalty.<br /> <br /> The idea behind this one is mostly in the psychology of how important a lair is to a beast. You prod the beast into dropping it's lair on you and it thinks it has the advantage and then you change it's realm into your own, a reversal on &quot;welcome to my lair&quot; as it were. It's probably not balanced but it was thought up spur of the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13063,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13063-lord-jub-jub","user":"Lord Jub-Jub","date":". 03-30-2017, 08:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13063-lord-jub-jub","name":"Lord Jub-Jub","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13063_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-27T12:40:43-07:00","id":1068803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1042575-mortal-remains-tooth-and-nail?p=1042966#post1042966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My point wasn't what Cheiron would choose to do, it's what implanting hungers would do effectively. As I said, ED is primarily circulatory, not a lack of desire problem.</div> </div> </div> </div>I look at it that Cheiron is using Beasts the way Chinese and other &quot;traditional&quot; medicines treat rhinos, tigers, dinosaur fossils, etc. If its an intimidating creature consuming its essence will make your penis strong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-27T14:22:39-07:00","id":1068876,"title":"","content":"Is &quot;going to group&quot; a workable option? For Vamps or Beasts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T14:37:43-07:00","id":1070307,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/204066/Hunter-Tooth-and-Nail?affiliate_id=498510\" target=\"_blank\">Now in print!</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patr